{"availability":"available","full":"Kedata-Indonesia/docflow","name":"docflow","description":"Open-source rich text editor with true page layout (A4/A5, page breaks) and real-time collaboration. TipTap/ProseMirror + Vue 3 + Yjs. Apache-2.0.","category":"Developer tools","language":"TypeScript","stars":5,"forks":0,"created":"2026-09-23T13:33:42Z","updated":"2026-10-08T07:23:42Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":null,"topics":["collaboration","editor","pagination","prosemirror","tiptap","typescript","vue3","yjs"],"demo":"https://dev-docflow-web.kedata.cloud/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T07:34:50.734Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T07:34:50.734Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T07:34:50.734Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T07:34:50.734Z","stars":5,"forks":0}],"technologies":["Vue"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["The open-source editor engine for document-style apps — true A4 pagination, real-time collaboration, and layout-aware AI. Free to embed (Apache-2.0); pay only for the cloud services around it.","Live demo · docflow-app (web UI + API server) · Docs","Built on TipTap / ProseMirror with a page pagination engine and Yjs-based collaboration."],"features":["True page layout — auto page-breaks, headers/footers with {page}/{total}, A4/Letter/Legal. TipTap offers this only via the paid Pages Pro extension; CKEditor gates it behind a premium plugin; OnlyOffice is heavyweight…","Apache-2.0 license — safe for commercial embedding and self-hosting. No copyleft anxiety, no premium gates. The core stays Apache-2.0 forever.","Real-time collaboration built in — Yjs CRDT out of the box, self-hostable. An alternative to TipTap Collab / Liveblocks without per-seat lock-in.","Layout-aware AI — AI drafts that respect A4 structure (e.g. prompt → paginated Indonesian formal letter) via the built-in aiStream / aiDraft ports.","Built in Indonesia — Bahasa-friendly, PDPA-friendly self-hosting."],"sourceUrl":"https://git